    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6402" root="جن" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجَنَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>A place in which one is veiled, concealed,
hidden, covered,</i> or <i>protected;</i> or <i>in which one
veils, conceals, hides, covers,</i> or <i>protects, himself.</i>
(S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A land <i>having in it</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِنّ</span>: (S:) or <i>abounding with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِنّ</span>. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُنُونٌ</span>.

